  m_text: 'You will explore a virtual museum containing 12 exhibits.


    Each exhibit
    has a 20-second observation period.


    CONTROLS

    WASD - Move around

    Mouse
    - Look around

    E - Start observing an exhibit

    P - Take a photo when
    instructed


    Some exhibits require you to take one photo. For others, simply
    observe.


    After visiting all exhibits, you will complete a short activity
    and a memory quiz.


    Please follow the on-screen instructions.'
